-- risk: additive
--
-- #2871 — two Run steps join the setup guide: notifications (who is told
-- what, by which channel, and the check-in reminder's lead time) and limits
-- (how far ahead, how long and how many places at once a member books).
-- Both are manual: workspace_setup_status (0539) reads a manual step as
-- ready from the owner's acknowledgement, whatever its id, and
-- readiness_acknowledgements takes any step id, so neither needs a
-- detector. Only the catalogue changes. Generated by
-- tool/build_setup_steps.dart.

